            <div xml:id="d618">

                <pb facs="0839" n="737" sameAs="frus:frus1935v01/pg737"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">765.84/868b: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Chargé in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Kirk</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1935-08-17T14:00:00-04:00">August 17, 1935—2
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>135. Please inform me immediately whether you would be able to deliver a
                    confidential message to Mussolini himself from this Government. Is the Chief of
                    Government in Rome, or, if not, how soon could such a message be delivered to
                    him by you?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
